{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51000","headline":"琲访刘君乙时已殁故将归王令留之不可以书来嘱作此篇示 · 詹敦仁","name":"琲访刘君乙时已殁故将归王令留之不可以书来嘱作此篇示","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"刘郎踪迹久荒凉，卜宅何妨处士乡。\n壮志莫随流俗变，老夫霜鬓已凝霜。\n（见《永乐大典》卷一三三四四「二寘」「示」字〖十四函一百三十七册〗引詹敦仁《清隐集》。\n案：琲爲詹敦仁之子。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"詹敦仁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51000.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51000","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}